# UI and brand

Design tokens live in [frontend/mobile/design.json](frontend/mobile/design.json). Prefer those colors and typography over ad-hoc values.

| Role | Token (example) |
| --- | --- |
| Primary green | `#19A10F` |
| Secondary blue | `#0045A5` |
| Surfaces | `#FFFFFF` / `#F7F9F8` |
| Text | `#172B2A`, `#60716F` |

Personality: clean, friendly, sustainability-focused—bright surfaces, restrained green emphasis, soft rounded shapes, generous spacing (see `designSystem` in `design.json`).

## Logo

Full wordmark: `assets/brand/circular_salone_logo.png` via `Image.asset('assets/brand/circular_salone_logo.png')`.

Do not recolor or distort the logo. For launcher icons, use the circular mark (arrows + leaf), not the wide wordmark, unless product specifies otherwise.

## Permissions

Declare Android permissions only with the feature that needs them, with in-app explanation in plain language.
